@* The bar across the top of an opening pack: which pack it is, and the way out of watching it.

   The way out is a button because it does one thing once. It used to be a checkbox sharing its
   flag with the preference on the shelf behind, so a player getting past one slow opening also
   turned the ceremony off for every pack they would ever open, and nothing said so. *@

<header class="opening-ceremony-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">@Caption</span>
    <button type="button" class="secondary" @onclick="Skipped">Skip animation</button>
</header>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public string Caption { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [Parameter]
    public EventCallback Skipped { get; set; }
}
